     "widget": {
      "name": "evidence_text",
      "multilineTextboxSpec": {
       "lines": [
        "# Evidence & Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "## Data sources\n",
        "Live dashboard reads persisted gold tables in `workspace.cutoverguard_migration_bad` and `workspace.cutoverguard_migration_fixed`.\n",
        "Independent count from the frozen source and the 50 authored swapped customer IDs: **811 affected orders**.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Scope\n",
        "Synthetic TPC-H benchmark; arbitrary price units, no currency. This crosswalk experiment differs from the earlier 50-order swap experiment.\n",
        "Source dates are interpreted as explicit UTC-midnight instants. Deliberate mapping defects, not observed bank migration failures.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Governance\n",
        "Promotion tests and update IDs are recorded separately. A ready review verdict is **not** production authorization.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Public retail\n",
        "Public retail tab uses historical UCI invoices with controlled candidate defects; DOI 10.24432/C5BW33, CC BY 4.0.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Methodology\n",
        "Keyed row-diff tools can detect ownership changes too; CutoverGuard adds signed effects, review decisions and a pipeline promotion gate."
       ]
      }
     },
     "position": {
